---
name: lite-qa-assignment
version: 1.0.0
description: QA assignment for the atm-bd-lite profile.
format: xml
required_variables: [task_id, phase, profile, repo, pr_number, branch, commit]
metadata:
  type: qa-assignment
  tags: [stage:qa, profile:lite]
---
<qa-task id="{{ task_id | string }}">
  <phase>{{ phase | string }}</phase>
  <profile>{{ profile | string }}</profile>
  <instructions>
    Review repository {{ repo }}, PR {{ pr_number }}, branch {{ branch }}, commit {{ commit }}.
    Read the task's acceptance criteria and
    verify each against the exact layer contents. Run the validation required by the task and inspect the
    stack using the installed sc-gh-stack-view skill. Report concrete evidence for every criterion.
    Close the QA task with PASS only when all criteria pass and no blocking or important findings remain;
    otherwise file findings and close with FAIL. Follow task-close T-CLOSE-03 and T-CLOSE-04.
    The task-close hook journals the bead update; never close or modify the QA bead directly.
  </instructions>
</qa-task>
